        }
      }
    },
    "Syncs papers, files, annotations, reading positions, and writings across your own devices. Use a separate device credential on each device; your library stays available offline. Credentials stay in Keychain, and LLM API keys and device preferences are not synced. The sync server can read uploaded content." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Syncs papers, files, annotations, reading positions, and writings across your own devices. Use a separate device credential on each device; your library stays available offline. Credentials stay in Keychain, and LLM API keys and device preferences are not synced. The sync server can read uploaded content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在自己的设备间同步论文、文件、批注、阅读位置和写作稿。每台设备使用独立的设备凭证，离线时仍可使用论文库。凭证保存在钥匙串中，LLM API 密钥和设备偏好不会同步。同步服务器可以读取上传的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” and all of its local files, notes, reading state, and translation cache will be removed." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@”及其所有本地文件、笔记、阅读状态和翻译缓存都将被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” will be moved to the Trash." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”将被移到废纸篓。"
